</surname><given-names>E.L.</given-names></name><name><surname>McLean</surname><given-names>I.W.H.</given-names></name><name><surname>Lane</surname><given-names>E.B.</given-names></name><name><surname>Pitera</surname><given-names>R.</given-names></name><name><surname>McMillan</surname><given-names>J.R.</given-names></name><name><surname>Dopping-Hepenstal</surname><given-names>P.J.C.</given-names></name><name><surname>Navsaria</surname><given-names>H.A.</given-names></name><name><surname>Leigh</surname><given-names>I.M.</given-names></name><name><surname>Eady</surname><given-names>R.A.J.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A functional &#x0201c;knockout&#x0201d; of human keratin 14</article-title><source>Genes Dev.</source><volume>8</volume><year>1994</year><fpage>2563</fpage><lpage>2573</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7525407</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="R50"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Rugg</surname><given-names>E.L.</given-names></name><name><surname>McLean</surname><given-names>W.H.I.</given-names></name><name><surname>Allison</surname><given-names>W.E.</given-names></name><name><surname>Lunny</surname><given-names>D.P.</given-names></name><name><surname>Macleod</surname><given-names>R.I.</given-names></name><name><surname>Felix</surname><given-names>D.H.</given-names></name><name><surname>Lane</surname><given-names>E.B.</given-names></name><name><surname>Munro</surname><given-names>C.S.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A mutation in the mucosal keratin K4 is associated with oral white sponge nevus</article-title><source>Nat. Genet.</source><volume>11</volume><year>1995</year><fpage>450</fpage><lpage>452</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7493030</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="R51"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Saitou</surname><given-names>M.</given-names></name><name><surname>Sugai</surname><given-names